    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LEONARD WILSON KEENAN ESTATE & LETTING AGENTS \r\nOur business is you....\r\n\r\nEXTRA SPACIOUS 4/5 BED 2 BATH FAMILY HOME \r\nMOST SOUGHT AFTER MATURE DEVELOPMENT OF HOMES\r\nIDYLLIC SETTING NOT OVERLOOKED\r\nEXTRA LARGE SITE \r\nPARKING FOR 4 CARS\r\nSOUTH FACING BACK GARDEN \r\n\r\nEARLY VIEWING STRONGLY ADVISED \r\n\r\nA lovely home in a great location....\r\n\r\nMulti Award Winning Team Patrick Leonard The Glasnevin Property Specialists are truly delighted to present this most spacious home to the Glasnevin property market.\r\n\r\nThe floor plan of No. 89 consists of: Entrance hall, living room, sitting room, kitchen / dining room, guest toilet and garage.\r\n\r\nUpstairs there is a landing, 4 bedrooms to include large primary with space for an en suite & family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe features of this home include: Modern fitted kitchen with an abundance of base and eye level storage & \r\ndoors from kitchen leading to garden.\r\n\r\nOutside there is a garden and large driveway with parking for 4 cars to the front. To the rear is a lawned south facing garden. \r\n\r\nThere are a wealth of amenities quite literally on your doorstep to include: Shops, parks, church, recreational facilities and sports clubs.\r\n\r\nThe property also falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools.\r\n\r\nFinglas, Phibsboro & Santry Villages together with The Charlestown Shopping Centre & Omni Shopping Centre are all close by.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is strongly advised.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
